If you'd like Slash'EM to run in ASCII mode by default:

1) Open your Slash'EM directory
2) Double click on defaults.nh
3) Open the file(I use WinXP, so I used notepad, for other OSes, I
don't know)
4) Find a line that reads:
#OPTIONS=windowtype:tty
5) Remove the # from the above line, so it appears as:
OPTIONS=windowtype:tty
6) Save
7) Run Slash'EM and enjoy.

OR

1) Select the Map from the Menu bar(next to File)
2) Select desired ASCII size from list
3) Play and enjoy





